title start
kind: note
tags: business-plan conventions database-field-mapping
Conventions database field mapping
title end

paragraph start
Every file becomes one database row. Its fields come from its path and its content, so no field has to be typed twice.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Folders become rows too, with the same fields minus the file ones.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
area number       from the area folder name
area name         from the area folder name
subfolder number  from the subfolder name
subfolder name    from the subfolder name
file number       from the file name
subject           from the file name
kind              from the kind line
tags              from the tags line
todo state        open, done or none, from the todo line
answers           from answer blocks, matched by question ID
code end

